{
  "uid": "rentcar-frontend",
  "title": "RentCar — Frontend",
  "description": "Experience percue par les visiteurs, mesuree dans leur navigateur (web-vitals) et relayee par le backend. Publie automatiquement par le pipeline backend-cd.",
  "tags": [
    "rentcar",
    "frontend"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROM",
        "label": "Source de donnees",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "Application",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(rentcar_web_vitals_total, application)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "Meme reglage que le tableau de bord backend. label_values() est evalue sur la plage de temps affichee : sur une plage ou le service dormait, il ne renvoie RIEN, la variable devient vide, et les panneaux interrogent application=\"\" -- qui ne correspond a aucune serie, d'ou le « No data » alors que la collecte fonctionne. D'ou : includeAll, pour retomber sur « All » au lieu du vide ; allValue \".*\", regexp que les panneaux appliquent avec =~ (et non =) ; refresh 2, pour reevaluer la liste a chaque changement de plage."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Affichage du contenu principal (LCP)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Temps au bout duquel le visiteur voit l'element principal de la page. Une part « poor » qui grimpe designe une image trop lourde ou un script bloquant. Seuil « bon » : 2,5 s.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rating) (increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"lcp\"}[1h]))\n  / scalar(sum(increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"lcp\"}[1h])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rating}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Reactivite aux interactions (INP)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Delai entre un clic et la reponse visible. Mesure le travail qui monopolise le fil principal du navigateur. Seuil « bon » : 200 ms.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rating) (increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"inp\"}[1h]))\n  / scalar(sum(increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"inp\"}[1h])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rating}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Stabilite visuelle (CLS)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Amplitude des decalages de mise en page pendant le chargement. Cause habituelle : des images ou des blocs sans dimensions reservees. Seuil « bon » : 0,1.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rating) (increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"cls\"}[1h]))\n  / scalar(sum(increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"cls\"}[1h])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rating}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Pages reellement visitees",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Nombre de chargements par ecran, mesure chez les visiteurs. Contrairement au trafic HTTP du backend, ce compte ignore les robots et les sondes : il ne recense que de vraies pages affichees dans de vrais navigateurs.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\", metric=\"lcp\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Mesures recues (24 h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
      },
      "description": "Volume total. S'il tombe a zero alors que le site est en ligne, la collecte cote navigateur ne fonctionne plus -- panne invisible autrement.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(rentcar_web_vitals_total{application=~\"$application\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "mesures",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROM}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
